136
00:09:00,021 --> 00:09:03,020
Forced to forego their normal methods,

137
00:09:03,021 --> 00:09:07,020
agents examined the card with a machine new to the FBI lab.

138
00:09:07,021 --> 00:09:10,020
A laser.

139
00:09:10,021 --> 00:09:14,020
Under an intense laser beam,

140
00:09:14,021 --> 00:09:17,820
human oil soaked into the paper 40 years earlier

141
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:19,820
