142
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:23,920
The faint outlines of a hidden fingerprint came to life.

143
00:09:25,060 --> 00:09:28,860
It matched the prints on Trifa's U.S. citizenship papers,

144
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:30,160
